2. CONTENT - All rights reserved
===============================================================================

Applies to everything in this repository that is not source code, and to
everything the build fetches from the syh-data repository, including but not
limited to:

  - the paintings and the photographs of them, wherever they appear, including
    public/painting_images/
  - the photographs of the artists with their paintings
  - the other photographs and images in public/, among them hero.jpg,
    tunisia.jpg, spoelhuis.jpg, truck-with-martin.jpg and
    syh_map_overview.png
  - the interface icons in public/icons/
  - the translated catalogues in public/translations/
  - the painting, artist, exhibition and story data in public/data/ and
    src/data/
  - the written text of the site, wherever it is stored, including the prose
    inside the source files
  - the Show Your Hope name, wordmark and logo

